# Attic — provisioning key manifest (copy to .env, which is gitignored).
# This is the staging home for every credential the Fable build will need.
# Fable formalizes the real config/secrets system (§7.F); this just gives
# provisioning a target so nothing is blocked. Status legend:
#   [HAVE]      already provisioned
#   [NOW-free]  get it now, free, ~2 min
#   [DEFER]     wait until Fable's design pins the exact need (paid or model-dependent)

# ── Analysis model (managed path) ────────────────────────────────────────────
# [HAVE] Extension already reads this from src/secrets.js (gitignored). Mirror here for the pipeline.
GEMINI_KEY=

# ── Grounding knowledge-base resolvers (§7.A) ────────────────────────────────
# MusicBrainz, Open Library, Wikidata need NO key (open APIs) — nothing to provision.
# [NOW-free] TMDB — themoviedb.org → Settings → API → request an API key (instant).
TMDB_API_KEY=
# [NOW-free] Spotify — developer.spotify.com/dashboard → Create app → Client ID + Secret.
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=
SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=
# [DEFER] Google Places — the only PAID grounding KB; needs a Google Cloud billing card.
#         Fable spikes the restaurant/Places path later — provision then, not now.
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=

# ── OSS / hosted inference for the local-first engine path (§7.A) ─────────────
# [DEFER] Fable picks the exact model (Qwen3-VL etc.) + provider first. Then sign up for ONE:
#         Together (broad OSS catalog) / Fireworks / Hugging Face. Don't sign up blind.
TOGETHER_API_KEY=
# HF_TOKEN=
# FIREWORKS_API_KEY=

# ── Reference / benchmark ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# [NOW-free] Twelve Labs — twelvelabs.io free account (the video-intelligence reference bar, R2).
TWELVELABS_API_KEY=

# ── Managed backend: sync + agency API + managed inference (§7.C/§7.I) ────────
# [DEFER] Fable picks the backend shape (user-held-file vs zero-knowledge server) first.
#         The connected Vercel + Supabase MCPs give it a sandbox. If reusing Supabase,
#         ROTATE the old leaked keys (risk #7) — do not reuse the compromised ones.
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
